- Regularization/losses: weighted gene MSE, prior proximity on S edges, group lasso (gene-column), Laplacian smoothness (A), marker anchoring (first d_marker in z), MMD batch alignment, nuisance correlation (percent.mt, nCount_RNA), latent decorrelation, subspace orthogonality (marker vs rest), set bottleneck; domain-adversarial (gradient reversal) on batch labels; post-finetune DEC-style clustering refinement with KL and augmentation consistency.
- Training: AMP, AdamW, ReduceLROnPlateau, stratified batch sampler by batch ID, warmup (epochs 1–30: GS frozen), finetune (31–60), DEC enabled after 60 with periodic target refresh; early stopping (patience 20).
- Post-training: save best checkpoint; export latent embeddings (all splits), set activities (per split), metadata; choose k via silhouette on train+val, ensemble KMeans on all; compute ARI vs cell_type; cluster summary (domain/protocol composition, top sets/genes, mean latent); UMAP plot; logs and pipeline summary.

