- DEC uses global targets computed over the whole train set, per-sample aligned, with consistency under gene-dropout and EMA-updated centers.
- Early stopping gated to start after finetune+10; checkpoint chosen by validation silhouette among {end_warmup, end_finetune, best_val}; validation objective excludes MMD/DANN but includes a silhouette bonus.
