[step_1] Current Behavior
- Preprocessing/variants:
  - Train-only global standardization (StandardScaler) and per-domain standardization using train stats; optional PCA whitening variant.
  - Cosine variant via row L2 normalization.
- Model selection (unsupervised, tuned on train labels):
  - Evaluates Leiden (grid over n_neighbors, resolution, seeds), KMeans, GMM (full/tied), Spectral (mutual kNN affinity), HDBSCAN (optional), for both cosine and euclidean.
  - Selects best by maximizing train ARI; tie-breaker by train silhouette. Records stability (mean pairwise ARI across seeds).
- Fitting and label transfer:
  - Fit chosen algo on train+val anchors; transfer to test via kNN propagation with k chosen by CV-ARI on train (3-fold half-split).
- Post-processing with gating:
  - One-pass kNN label smoothing; then merge clusters smaller than 20 into nearest large centroid. Apply each step only if train ARI does not drop and silhouette does not degrade beyond small tolerance.
- Metrics and outputs:
  - Writes cluster assignments CSV.
  - Computes overall and per-split ARI; stores detailed selection metadata (variant, metric, algorithm, params, best train ARI/sil, stability, k_transfer, CV score, applied smoothing/merging, train ARI/sil before/after, n_clusters_final) in cluster_metrics.json.
  - Pathway/marker activities: aligns prior gene sets to dataset genes, row-normalizes set matrix, computes per-cell set scores, per-cluster Wilcoxon with BH-FDR, AUC; reports top enriched sets and top DEGs per cluster. Subsets to HVGs (up to 3k) to speed up.
  - Produces cluster_summary.json and CSV, and a UMAP PNG.

Step Change
- Selection objective: from silhouette-based (and optional DEC k) to ARI-on-train with silhouette tie-break; records stability; adds fine resolution zoom for Leiden.
- Algorithms: added GMM, Spectral (mutual kNN affinity with symmetric, row-normalized graph), HDBSCAN with noise reassignment; expanded k and neighbor grids.
- Standardization: switches to train-only stats (globally and per-domain) to avoid leakage; adds PCA whitening variant.
- Label transfer: from centroid assignment to kNN propagation with k chosen by CV-ARI on train.
- Post-processing: smoothing and micro-cluster merging now gated by train ARI/silhouette safeguards.
- DEG/activity: adds HVG subsetting for efficiency; optimizes set testing by prefiltering positive-effect candidates; more robust AUC fallback.
- Bugfix: mean_pairwise_ari condition fixed (previous HTML entity issue).
- Outputs: adds cluster_summary.csv and richer selection block in metrics JSON.

